@startuml code-packages
' Where the code of Yeah lives: the modules of `lib/' in nine packages.
'
' The nine packages are the nine of `docs/SITE-DIAGRAMS-PLAN.md' §8 (D8):
' the journal and the projections, the control of a run, the adapter of the
' model, the tools and the registry, the rights and the approvals, the
' protocols and the wire, the interface and the product, the delegation and
' the subagents, the placements and the plumbing.
'
' Every module of `lib/' is in exactly one of them and is named with the line
' of its definition, as `file:line'.  The modules that are in no package of
' the picture are listed in the note at the end of this file, with the reason
' why they are not there.

package "journal and projections" as journal {
  component "the journal of the run and its projections\nlib/yeah-session.el:37\nlib/yeah-events.el:30\nlib/yeah-journal.el:33\nlib/yeah-context.el:29\nlib/yeah-compact.el:27\nlib/yeah-todo.el:46\nlib/yeah-ui.el:23\nlib/yeah-faces.el:28\nlib/yeah-session-list.el:29\nlib/yeah-sessions.el:29\nlib/yeah-org.el:28\nlib/yeah-markdown.el:22" as journal_modules
}

