note bottom
  The modules of lib/ that this picture does not name, and why:
  lib/yeah-codes.el -- experimental: disabled by default and not wired into the agent loop.
  lib/yeah-state-diagram.el -- the generator of the state diagram: a tool of the author, not a component of the harness at run time.
end note
